    "included": "1 TB to 20 TB a month by plan; G8 and GPU plans include none",
    "note": "US$0.005 per GB of outbound transfer beyond the plan's allowance, which is pooled across the account and prorated for part-months. Inbound traffic and traffic inside a data centre over IPv6, a VLAN, a VPC or a private IPv4 address are free. Not priced by the calculator.",
